{"parentUuid":"85fd4c05-99f0-48f3-9de4-91248d286d93","isSidechain":false,"message":{"id":"msg_202608120214073c92b691afb54f41","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"glm-5.2","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I now have a very good understanding of the formatting style. The previous lectures use:\n- Title with `#`\n- A blockquote block at the top with prerequisite lectures and a transition paragraph\n- Numbered sections (## 1, ## 2, etc.)\n- Tables, code blocks with ASCII diagrams\n- Permalinks with the full URL format\n- Math with `\\(...\\)` and `\\[...\\]`\n\nLet me also check how the summary file format looks so I know whether I need to write one. Looking at the task: \"1. 只生成 `ImageStitchBasedOnFPGA-tutorial/u5-l3-system-integration-tradeoffs.md` 这一个文件。\" — I only need to generate the one lecture file, not the summary file. Good.\n\nWait, let me re-read: \"完成后，用一句话总结本讲义覆盖的最小模块。\" — this is just a one-line summary in my response, not a file. The summary.md files are generated by a separate process perhaps. Let me check the instructions again.\n\nThe task says: \"1. 只生成 `ImageStitchBasedOnFPGA-tutorial/u5-l3-system-integration-tradeoffs.md` 这一个文件。\" So I only write the one lecture file. Good.\n\nNow let me plan the lecture content. This is the capstone lecture (u5-l3) for the whole handbook. It synthesizes everything. The topic: 综合全项目，讨论七路摄像头拼接的整体系统架构、双线性vs最近邻插值的资源/质量取舍、Block RAM资源占用、时序收敛，以及README中遗留问题的改进方向。\n\nLearning goals:\n- 建立完整系统的数据通路与控制时序视图\n- 理解插值方法、存储结构在FPGA资源与图像质量间的权衡\n- 能针对README列出的遗留问题提出可落地的改进思路\n\nMinimal modules:\n- 系统架构\n- 资源取舍\n- 遗留问题改进\n\nSource files:\n- README.md\n- 圆柱面投影.v\n- 圆柱面投影.cpp\n- DDR3控制/mem_burst.v\n- 动态规划法寻找最佳缝合线/DynamicSeam.v\n\nPractice task: 撰写一份系统设计改进建议，针对'小数权重融合''白平衡采集''插值方法选择'三个方向各提出一个可落地的FPGA实现思路。\n\nDependencies: u4-l1, u5-l1, u5-l2\n\nNow I need to structure this as the capstone. Let me think about the 3 minimal modules (4.x sections):\n\n### 4.1 系统架构：七路摄像头拼接的完整数据通路与控制时序\n- 4.1.1 概念说明 — 把全系统的数据通路和控制时序串起来\n- 4.1.2 核心流程 — 完整数据流图，从采集到输出；各模块在哪些时钟域；哪些是已实现/未实现\n- 4.1.3 源码精读 — 引用各文件的关键点，建立端到端视图\n- 4.1.4 代码实践 — 画出完整数据通路与时钟域图\n- 4.1.5 小练习与答案\n\n### 4.2 资源取舍：插值方法、存储结构与Block RAM占用\n- 4.2.1 概念说明 — 双线性vs最近邻、Block RAM vs 二维寄存器数组\n- 4.2.2 核心流程 — 资源/质量权衡的决策树\n- 4.2.3 源码精读 — 引用README对插值的讨论、圆柱面投影.v的weight处理、cpp的weight表\n- 4.2.4 代码实践 — 估算Block RAM占用、对比两种方案\n- 4.2.5 小练习与答案\n\n### 4.3 遗留问题改进：从「半成品」到「可量产」的工程路径\n- 4.3.1 概念说明 — README列出的两个「做得不好」（白平衡、小数权重融合）+ 其他遗留（DynamicSeam不可综合、24→64 FIFO未收录）\n- 4.3.2 核心流程 — 针对每个遗留问题给出改进架构\n- 4.3.3 源码精读 — 引用README、DynamicSeam、圆柱面投影.v中的问题点\n- 4.3.4 代码实践 — 撰写系统设计改进建议（这是practice_task）\n- 4.3.5 小练习与答案\n\nThen:\n## 5. 综合实践 — 一个贯穿全讲的整合任务\n## 6. 本讲小结\n## 7. 下一步学习建议\n\nLet me make sure I ground every claim in real source code. Let me note the key line references:\n\nREADME.md:\n- L2-4: 做得不好的地方 (白平衡、小数权重)\n- L5: 需要注意的地方\n- L6-9: 24→64bit异步FIFO (Block RAM不能用、二维寄存器数组、200MHz出错100MHz可以、width=8bit、depth、读指针+3写指针+8、格雷码失效)\n- L10-14: 圆柱面投影算法 (双线性vs最近邻；双线性两种方法——四个相同BRAM vs 奇偶行列；最近邻推荐)\n- L15-16: 时序问题\n\n圆柱面投影.v:\n- L23-27: module端口\n- L30: coe (2707.47)\n- L56-59: dst_tl/br寄存器\n- L62-70: k_inv0~8\n- L72-111: always块（定点投影、weight生成）\n- L84-92: 矩阵乘 tmp/x/y/z（阻塞赋值，单时钟）\n- L93-100: weight_xN/weight_yN（实为整数坐标，floor/ceil）\n- L113-118: cordic_0例化\n\n圆柱面投影.cpp:\n- L30: scale = 2707.47f\n- L36-49: mapForward\n- L50-67: mapBackward (有x/=z透视除法)\n- L148-266: warp (addr表L184-191, weight表L198-205, res融合L239-254)\n- L195-206: weight表（注意后两项y因子错位，u2-l3已指出）\n- L262: remap (真正用的)\n- L388: GraphCutSeamFinder\n- L451: FeatherBlender\n- L453: setSharpness(0.1)\n- L492: imwrite(\"pano.jpg\")\n\nmem_burst.v:\n- L3-7: module + parameter\n- L8-40: 端口\n- L44-51: localparam状态\n- L78-233: 状态机\n\nDynamicSeam.v:\n- L21-23: 注释「外部代码不能综合」\n- L25-26: parameter + 输入端口\n- L30-34: row1/row2/cost/coordinate数组、cnt\n- L38-47: clk_wiz_0例化（注意L46 cl_p写错，应该是clk_p）\n- L54-59: parameter状态（误用）\n- L91-97: 第一段状态机\n- L121: always@(posedge sys_clk) 注释200MHz\n- L142-181: row/col/read_col控制（用parameter当变量自增）\n- L184-265: always块里例化mig + DP逻辑\n  - L192-232: mig_7series_0例化在always里（致命错误）\n  - L195: ddr3_ck_n端口损坏\n  - L248-249: localparam在always内声明并赋值\n  - L250-261: DP代价更新逻辑\n\nNow let me think about the resource/quality tradeoff discussion carefully. From README L12-14:\n- 双线性插值：需要一拍取四个像素。方法1：四份相同BRAM各自不同地址（资源大、简单）。方法2：奇偶行奇偶列存到不同BRAM（仿真OK但下板时序不对）。作者最终用方法1。\n- 最近邻：简单实用，工程推荐。\n\nFrom README L7 (24→64 FIFO): Block RAM不能用（位宽须满足2^n关系），改用二维寄存器数组，代价是写端频率受限（200MHz出错、100MHz可以）。\n\nThis is the key tension:\n1. 双线性要4份BRAM → Block RAM资源占用大\n2. 但24→64 FIFO的存储因为位宽比非2^n又不能用BRAM → 被迫用寄存器\n3. 时序收敛难（投影时序、奇偶行列方案下板时序不对）\n\nSo there's an interesting resource tension: the system both heavily uses and is constrained from using Block RAM, depending on the sub-module. Let me articulate this.\n\nFor the tradeoff table:\n\n| 决策点 | 选项A | 选项B | 本项目选择 | 理由 |\n|--------|-------|-------|-----------|------|\n| 插值方法 | 双线性(4像素加权) | 最近邻(取1像素) | 投影模块实为最近邻(简化教学)，README推荐工程用最近邻 | 双线性要一拍取4像素→资源/时序代价大 |\n| 双线性取4像素的实现 | 4份相同BRAM | 奇偶行列分BRAM | 作者选4份相同BRAM | 奇偶方案下板时序不对 |\n| 24→64位宽转换存储 | Block RAM | 二维寄存器数组 | 寄存器数组 | 位宽比3:8含因子3，不满足2^n，BRAM不可用 |\n| FIFO写端时钟 | 200MHz | 100MHz | 100MHz | 寄存器数组200MHz写会出错 |\n\nNow, the遗留问题改进 section. README lists:\n1. 图像采集模块没做好，白平衡之类的 (L3)\n2. 图像融合部分的小数权重没做好 (L4)\n\nPlus from code analysis:\n3. DynamicSeam不可综合 (u4-l1)\n4. 24→64 FIFO未收录 (u3-l3)\n5. 投影模块跳过透视除法、丢弃小数权重 (u2-l4)\n\nThe practice task asks for improvements on three directions: 小数权重融合, 白平衡采集, 插值方法选择. So I should give concrete FPGA implementation ideas for each:\n\n**小数权重融合改进**:\n- 现状：圆柱面投影.v L93-100 的 weight_xN/weight_yN 实为整数坐标，真正小数权重被丢弃，等价最近邻。\n- 改进思路：\n  1. 保留定点坐标的小数部分（x[29:0]的低26位是小数）。目前 x 是56位、Q26.30（30位小数），floor取 x[55:30]，那么 x[29:0] 就是小数部分。\n  2. 设 fx = x[29:0]（x方向小数），fy = y[29:0]（y方向小数）。四个权重：\n     - w00 = (1-fx)(1-fy)\n     - w01 = (1-fx)fy\n     - w10 = fx(1-fy)\n     - w11 = fx*fy\n  3. 用4个BRAM（或4端口）取4个邻居像素，按权重加权求和。\n  4. 权重用查表或定点乘法；为省资源，小数位可截到8位。\n  5. 对应cpp L198-205的weight表（注意修正y因子错位）。\n\n**白平衡采集改进**:\n- 现状：README L3说采集模块白平衡没做好。仓库里没有采集模块代码。\n- 改进思路：\n  1. 灰度世界法（Gray World）：假设场景平均色为灰，分别统计R/G/B通道平均值，求增益 g_R=avg/avg_R 等，在采集端或DDR3写回时乘增益。\n  2. 硬件实现：用累加器统计每帧（或每行）R/G/B之和，帧末除法求增益（或查表），下一帧应用。\n  3. 因为24bit像素是R/G/B各8bit，可在24→64 FIFO之前插入一个「增益乘法」级。\n\n**插值方法选择改进**:\n- 现状：README L12-14，双线性资源大、最近邻质量差。\n- 改进思路：\n  1. 折中：只在重叠区/缝合线附近用双线性（质量敏感区），非重叠区用最近邻。\n  2. 或：用「双线性但4像素从单个双端口BRAM分2拍取」——牺牲一点吞吐换资源。\n  3. 或：预计算查表（.coe）把weight表固化，运行时只查表不计算。\n\nLet me now also build the end-to-end data path. The full pipeline (from u1-l1 and u2-l1):\n\n采集(7路摄像头,24bit) → [白平衡:未实现] → 24→64bit异步FIFO(未收录) → DDR3(mem_burst/mig) → 圆柱面投影(project模块, cordic+定点) → [重叠区像素回读DDR3] → 缝合线(DynamicSeam, DP) → 融合(FeatherBlender的硬件版:未实现,小数权重没做好) → 输出\n\nSoftware reference (圆柱面投影.cpp main):\n特征提取(ORB) → 匹配(2NN) → 估计(Homography) → 光束平差 → 投影(CylindricalWarper) → 曝光补偿 → 缝合线(GraphCut) → 融合(Feather)\n\nKey mapping (software one-time → hardware constants):\n- ORB/匹配/估计/光束平差 → 离线一次，产出 K、R → 烧成 k_inv定点系数、coe焦距倒数\n- 投影 → project模块（cordic_0 + 定点矩阵乘）\n- 缝合线 → GraphCut(C++) vs DynamicSeam(硬件DP草稿)\n- 融合 → FeatherBlender(C++) vs 未实现的硬件融合\n\nClock domains (from u5-l2):\n- 晶振200MHz差分 → clk_wiz_0 → sys_clk → MIG(sys_clk_i) → ui_clk(=mem_clk)\n- project模块用 clk（独立）\n- 异步FIFO跨时钟域：摄像头域(100MHz写) ↔ DDR3域(ui_clk读)\n- DynamicSeam错误地用sys_clk驱动app_*\n\nLet me write this comprehensively. I want it to be thorough but not bloated. The previous lectures are ~30-44KB. This is a capstone so it can be substantial.\n\nLet me write it now. I'll structure carefully.\n\nFor permalinks, the base is: https://github.com/mhhai/ImageStitchBasedOnFPGA/blob/8728b11c25af93dd1b4f7606aca64433827adfd5/\n\nFormat: [文件路径:L起始-L结束](<base>/<相对路径>#L起始-L结束)\n\nNote: the filenames have Chinese characters. In the URL, Chinese characters should be URL-encoded or kept as-is? Looking at u5-l2, it kept them as-is in the link text but the actual URL... let me check. In u5-l2 line 53: `[圆柱面投影.v](https://github.com/mhhai/ImageStitchBasedOnFPGA/blob/8728b11c25af93dd1b4f7606aca64433827adfd5/圆柱面投影.v)` — kept as-is. GitHub handles UTF-8 paths. For line anchors, format is `#L30-L30`. Let me use that.\n\nLet me write the lecture. I'll aim for high quality, deep synthesis, grounded in real code.\n\nLet me be careful about the structure required:\n- ## 1. 本讲目标\n- ## 2. 前置知识\n- ## 3. 本讲源码地图\n- ## 4. 核心概念与源码讲解 (with 4.x modules, each having 4.x.1-4.x.5)\n- ## 5. 综合实践\n- ## 6. 本讲小结\n- ## 7. 下一步学习建议\n\nLet me write it.\n\nFor 4.1 (系统架构):\n- 4.1.1 概念说明\n- 4.1.2 核心流程 (端到端数据通路图 + 软硬件阶段对照)\n- 4.1.3 源码精读 (各文件在通路中的位置)\n- 4.1.4 代码实践 (画完整数据通路与时钟域标注图)\n- 4.1.5 小练习与答案\n\nFor 4.2 (资源取舍):\n- 4.2.1 概念说明\n- 4.2.2 核心流程 (权衡决策)\n- 4.2.3 源码精读\n- 4.2.4 代码实践 (Block RAM占用估算)\n- 4.2.5 小练习与答案\n\nFor 4.3 (遗留问题改进):\n- 4.3.1 概念说明\n- 4.3.2 核心流程\n- 4.3.3 源码精读\n- 4.3.4 代码实践 (撰写系统设计改进建议 — the main practice_task)\n- 4.3.5 小练习与答案\n\nThen ## 5 综合实践 (a capstone task tying everything together), ## 6 小结, ## 7 下一步.\n\nNow let me write. I'll be detailed and use real line numbers.\n\nLet me double check some line numbers I'll cite:\n- README.md L3: 白平衡\n- README.md L4: 小数权重\n- README.md L7: Block RAM不能用 + 200MHz出错100MHz可以\n- README.md L8: width=8bit, depth\n- README.md L9: 读指针+3写指针+8, 格雷码失效\n- README.md L12-14: 双线性vs最近邻\n- README.md L13: 四个相同BRAM vs 奇偶行列\n- README.md L16: 时序问题想发论文\n\n- 圆柱面投影.v L30: coe\n- 圆柱面投影.v L56-59: dst_tl/br\n- 圆柱面投影.v L62-70: k_inv\n- 圆柱面投影.v L84-92: 矩阵乘（tmp1/2/3, x/y/z）— 阻塞赋值\n- 圆柱面投影.v L93-100: weight_xN/weight_yN = floor/ceil坐标\n- 圆柱面投影.v L113-118: cordic_0\n\n- 圆柱面投影.cpp L30: scale=2707.47f\n- L50-67: mapBackward (L65 x/=z透视除法)\n- L198-205: weight表\n- L239-254: res融合（加权求和）\n- L262: remap\n- L388: GraphCutSeamFinder\n- L451-453: FeatherBlender setSharpness(0.1)\n- L492: pano.jpg\n\n- mem_burst.v L3-7: module/parameter\n- L44-51: 状态localparam\n- L102: init_calib_complete门控\n- L111,118: {addr,3'd0} 地址拼接\n\n- DynamicSeam.v L22-23: 注释「外部代码不能综合」(actually L22 is inside comment block, L21-23 is the comment)\n- L25-26: parameter/端口\n- L30-33: row1/row2/cost/coordinate\n- L46: cl_p (应为clk_p，拼写错误)\n- L57-59: parameter row/col/read_col误用\n- L142-181: parameter当变量自增\n- L192-232: mig例化在always里\n- L195: ddr3_ck_n端口损坏\n- L248-249: localparam在always内\n- L250-261: DP逻辑\n\nLet me verify DynamicSeam L21-23 comment. The file shows:\n```\n21\t//////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////\n22\t/*外部代码不能综合  (原文是乱码注释，意思是\"外部代码不能综合\")\n23\t*/\n```\nActually the raw bytes are garbled (GBK encoded shown as UTF-8), but the summary says it means \"外部代码不能综合\". The u4-l1 summary confirms: \"该文件仅是算法草稿、不可综合\". And the comment at top L22 region says something like \"外部代码不能综合\". I'll reference L21-23 as the comment indicating non-synthesizability. Let me be a bit careful — I'll say \"文件顶部注释即声明\" and reference it. Actually let me re-read: line 22 has `/*...*/` which is the start of a comment. Given the GBK garbling, I'll describe it as the author's note. The u4-l1 lecture already established this. I'll cite it as L21-23.\n\nNow, let me write the full lecture. I'll make it comprehensive and high-quality.\n\nI need to be careful with math: use \\( ... \\) inline and \\[ ... \\] display, NOT $...$.\n\nLet me write it now.\n\nActually, let me reconsider the depth of 4.1.4 — the practice there. And I should make the main practice_task (system design improvement) prominent, which I'll put in 4.3.4 and also reference in section 5 综合实践.\n\nLet me make section 5 a richer capstone that ties the data path + tradeoff + improvement together — e.g., \"为这个系统写一份完整的工程评审报告\" with sub-tasks. And 4.3.4 focuses specifically on the three improvement directions (the required practice_task).\n\nActually, re-reading the spec: the practice_task for this lecture is exactly \"撰写一份系统设计改进建议，针对'小数权重融合''白平衡采集''插值方法选择'三个方向各提出一个可落地的FPGA实现思路。\" So I should make 4.3.4 (or the 综合 practice) center on this. I'll put the detailed three-direction improvement design as 4.3.4 代码实践, and make section 5 综合实践 a broader capstone (e.g., end-to-end resource budget + improvement roadmap).\n\nLet me write now. I'll write a comprehensive, well-structured lecture.\n\nOne more thing: I should write a summary.md? No — the task says only generate the one lecture file. The .summary.md files are generated separately (probably by the orchestrator after). I'll just write the lecture and give a one-line summary in my final message.\n\nLet me write the file.","signature":"582666b52bb94b22801c105a"}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2696,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":57280,"output_tokens":19770,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"stop_details":null},"type":"assistant","uuid":"b1bbfe7e-e9a4-4092-b8eb-d73433175d37","timestamp":"2026-08-11T18:15:11.832Z","effort":"high","userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-cli","cwd":"/home/runner/work/codeReader/codeReader/work/mhhai-ImageStitchBasedOnFPGA","sessionId":"5561523b-409a-44af-84bb-c577062be2f6","version":"2.1.227","gitBranch":"master"}
